# Park News: The Gettysburg Quarterly (the official newsletter of Gettysburg National Military Park, National Park Service), issues of 2005 to 2013, saved from npshistory.com 2026-11-16 (4 pages each). The standard text of these PDFs interleaves columns and sidebars, so every quote is a cleaned quote (letters and digits matched, hyphenation and ligature characters of the text layer ignored) cut from the content-stream-order text (flag ~R).
# A newsletter dates the work it reports: a fence, orchard, woodlot or house restored or replanted there is a modern or rebuilt state (use indirect) and never an 1863 profile; what park historians say about 1863 is use direct; a later feature (the visitor center, the Cyclorama building, modern houses) is use none.
# Workstream bt-web, task nps-landscape, third milestone.

